        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Commercial 4-1/2\" x 4-1/2\" x Square Corners Single Action Spring Hinge</b>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with One Single Action Spring Door Hinge, Allen Adjusting Wrench, Locking Pins,  plus #12 x 1-1/4\" Wood  Screws and #12- x 1/2\" Machine Screws.  Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>UL Listed</b> (R18063) Fired Rated. The included Allen Wrench Tool is use to adjust spring tension.  The Locking Pin holds the Spring in tension after it is set. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Commercial Spring Door Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Corners</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.134\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed, Fire Rated</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 5</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
